        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wild_Horse%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "An old one‑room schoolhouse once served Wild Horse’s children, now closed but still standing as a historic landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
